==Esperanto==

===Verb===
{{eo-verb|mank}}

# to be lacking, to be missing; to be wanting
#: La domo '''mankas''' inan efekton.''
#: ''The house lacks a woman's touch.''
#: 
#: La tezo '''mankas''' bibliografion.
#: ''The term paper '''is missing''' a bibliography.''
#: 
#: La Sinjoro estas mia pastro; Nenion mi '''mankos''' &mdash; Psalmo 23:1
#: ''The Lord is my shepherd, I shall not '''want''' &mdash; Psalm 23:1''

